{"schema": 2, "id": "ruler-DAN", "title": "Danemark", "label": "Danemark", "description": "État souverain et monarchie constitutionnelle transcontinentale", "extract": "Le Danemark, en forme longue le royaume de Danemark, est un pays transcontinental dont le territoire métropolitain est situé en Europe du Nord et en Scandinavie. Il comprend également les régions autonomes des îles Féroé, en Atlantique Nord, et le Groenland, en Amérique du Nord. Sa capitale et plus grande ville est Copenhague.", "type": "ruler", "typeLabel": "Souveraineté", "continents": ["Afrique", "Ameriques", "Europe"], "epochs": ["antiquite", "moyen-age", "moderne", "contemporain"], "from": 381, "to": 2000, "itemCount": 47, "items": ["Agder", "Akershus", "Akureyri", "Armor", "Bergenshus", "Blekinge", "Bohuslän", "Bornholm", "Derby", "Eidsiva", "Eiriksfjord", "Estland", "Färöarnax", "Finnmark", "Fyn", "Gold Coast", "Gotland", "Greenland", "Halland", "Hålogaland", "Holstein", "Jämtland", "Lauenburg", "Lincoln", "Lolland", "Lübeck", "Midtjylland", "Morbihan", "Narva", "Nordjylland", "Norfolk", "Oldenburg", "Ösel", "Reykjavik", "Ribe", "Sjælland", "Skåne", "Slesvig", "Småland", "Sogn"], "source": "https://fr.wikipedia.org/wiki/Danemark", "articleLicense": "CC BY-SA 4.0", "image": "", "imageCredit": {"filename": "Kingdom_of_Denmark_(orthographic_projection).svg", "artist": "Orionist", "license": "CC BY-SA 3.0", "licenseUrl": "https://creativecommons.org/licenses/by-sa/3.0", "credit": "Own work This W3C-unspecified vector image was created with Adobe Illustrator .", "page": "https://commons.wikimedia.org/wiki/File:Kingdom_of_Denmark_(orthographic_projection).svg"}, "revision": "", "sha256": "8166c5e1da453db422b4318ac66cd1b7afe49e2eeca566cc8ba44d42a96f7d35"}